course: dictionary
lesson: 16039
title: A doctor for animals
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A long word can still be easy to understand when you look at the words around it. «Mia took her cat to the veterinarian because its paw was sore.» Sore and paw tell you the cat was hurt, so the veterinarian must be the person who helps it.
explain: A veterinarian is a doctor who looks after sick and injured animals and helps keep them healthy. Pets, farm animals and zoo animals can all need one.
explain: People in the UK, Ireland, Australia and New Zealand often shorten it to «vet». Americans and Canadians usually say veterinarian. Both words mean exactly the same thing.
fact: A veterinarian is a doctor for animals.
fact: «Veterinarian» means a doctor who looks after sick and injured animals.
fact: Veterinarians help keep animals healthy, not only when they are hurt.
fact: In the UK, Ireland, Australia and New Zealand, people usually say «vet».
fact: To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence: «Mia took her cat to the animal doctor» still makes sense, so you have it right.
exercise: «Mia took her cat to the veterinarian because its paw was sore.» Who is the veterinarian? | A shop worker who sells pet food | *A doctor who looks after sick animals | A teacher at a school | A farmer who grows crops
exercise: Sam says he will take his rabbit to the «vet». What does vet mean? | A type of carrot | *A short word for veterinarian | A kind of rabbit food | A place where people buy pets
exercise: «The veterinarian gave the injured horse some medicine.» Why did the horse need the veterinarian? | Because it wanted a new saddle | Because it was winning a race | Because it was sleeping | *Because it was hurt
test: Which job helps keep animals healthy? | *A veterinarian | A baker | A builder | A pilot
test: Ruby's puppy was sick, so her family took it to the | sea | bus station | library | *veterinarian
exam: Which sentence uses veterinarian correctly? | The veterinarian painted the classroom wall | The veterinarian baked a cake for the school fair | *The veterinarian checked the injured bird's wing | The veterinarian sang a song at assembly
